rd_kit.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/period_intentions.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-nh.6.1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-nh/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-nh.6.1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared property ownership and card editor registry[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ownership[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ownership: capture the unchanged album, record, and bank acceptance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline, generalize selective property hiding into propertyCardOwnKeys,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and replace the closed double-equals dispatch with registerPropertyCard.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Migrate all three cards, preserving existing assertions, gates, command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identities, and editor behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared Reading and Live Preview host lifecycle[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]host[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ownership[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]host: extract createPropertyCardHost and move album, record, and bank [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lifecycle plumbing onto it. Preserve species models, anchors, caches, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record-walk integration, Source-mode bank lint, embed display behavior, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and cleanup.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared property-card chrome and precise documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chrome[dim] · [dim][/dim]after host[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chrome: consolidate property-card chrome and hue tokens without changing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pixels, align the three plugin references around card versus card [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor, and document the extension API for the intention-card phase. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Compare final screenshots to the original baseline, run the complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acceptance gates, and deploy with bob plugins sync. Prepare completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]evidence for the land agent; do not close bob-cli-nh.6 or bob-cli-nh [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from a child phase.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-nh.6.1","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","output_variables":{"artifacts":[{"kind":"markdown","label":"ownership-phase-evidence","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261119094540/property_kit_ownership_evidence-dbcb4d76b19b.md","ref":"file:explicit:0f3ef158298d15417a5fa040","source_path":"/tmp/property_kit_ownership_evidence.md"},{"kind":"file","label":"ownership-new-tests-log","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261119094540/new_tests-06b655f3b2da.log","ref":"file:explicit:f52763f9461789cd6c4d266e","source_path":"/tmp/new_tests.log"},{"kind":"file","label":"ownership-ownership-tests-log","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261119094540/ownership_test2-e7a535d633c9.log","ref":"file:explicit:a157201efa8e932c585ec287","source_path":"/tmp/ownership_test2.log"}]},"patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-nh.6.1.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a14e1924751f8b2a1807aa853a8d7ee5","started_at":"2026-11-19T14:46:20.894560+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"eed2f02e6f2614c7d32adbd68abc2893fe5445ef186aa60d1ee4b064cda965ac","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-nh.7/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"4562552907de3